1
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:05,672
All right,
I'm moving my infantry division...

2
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:08,759
(Sheldon:)...augmented by a battalion of orcs
from Lord of the Rings.

3
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:10,595
(Sheldon:)We flank the Tennessee volunteers...

4
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:13,930
(Sheldon:)...and the North once again
wins the Battle of Gettysburg.

5
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:17,187
(Howard:)Not so fast. Remember, the South
still has two infantry divisions.

6
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,640
(Howard:)Plus Superman and Godzilla.

7
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,690
(Leonard:)No, no, no. Orcs are magic.

8
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:23,355
(Leonard:)Superman is vulnerable to magic.

9
00:00:23,523 --> 00:00:25,563
(Leonard:)Not to mention,
you already lost Godzilla...

10
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:28,024
(Leonard:)...to the Illinois cavalry and Hulk.

11
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:32,405
(Raj:)Why don't you just have Robert E. Lee
charge the line with Shiva and Ganesh?

12
00:00:32,574 --> 00:00:34,154
(Penny:)- You guys ready to order?
- Hang on.

13
00:00:34,325 --> 00:00:35,905
(Howard:)Shiva and Ganesh?

14
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:38,577
(Howard:)The Hindu gods
against the entire Union Army?

15
00:00:38,747 --> 00:00:40,457
(Leonard:)And orcs.

16
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:42,123
(Penny:)I'll be back.

17
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:45,792
(Raj:)Excuse me. Ganesh is the remover
of obstacles and Shiva's the destroyer.

18
00:00:45,962 --> 00:00:48,552
(Raj:)When the smoke clears,
Lincoln will be speaking Hindi...

19
00:00:48,715 --> 00:00:50,295
(Raj:)...and drinking mint juleps.

20
00:00:50,842 --> 00:00:54,262
My boss says you have to either
order or leave and never come back.

21
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:57,809
(Howard:)What do you recommend for someone
with a man-sized appetite...

22
00:00:57,974 --> 00:01:00,434
(Howard:)...from a morning of
weight-training and cardio-funk?

23
00:01:00,602 --> 00:01:02,022
(Penny:)A shower.

